=1742234442\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252160/extras/46049b6ebd846e7d3c5c3ce028646bda.webm?t=1742234442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252160/extras/46049b6ebd846e7d3c5c3ce028646bda.mp4?t=1742234442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Back</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to fully upgrade and fight back stronger than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252160/extras/2c1e9520c3722a4f04fcff755a4d38ee.poster.avif?t=1742234442\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252160/extras/2c1e9520c3722a4f04fcff755a4d38ee.webm?t=1742234442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252160/extras/2c1e9520c3722a4f04fcff755a4d38ee.mp4?t=1742234442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five lanes</strong> of frantic fun, full of enemies attacking your farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six skills</strong> to master and deploy in each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short runs</strong> of 5-10 minutes packed with action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five unlockable characters</strong> with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six permanent upgrades</strong> to unlock for long-term progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of different enemies</strong> and challenging bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to defend your farm? Kitty and her friends are counting on you!</p>",
